Search elsewhere, any spot that might have a door.  If
it takes prayer to resolve Weak from hunger while you
search that's what happens in some games.

Also try kicking in spots you think might have a door.
It may take some patience to recover your health
between kicks so search while you heal.  Kick, move
to the next spot, search until you are back to max hit
points, kick, move on to the next spot.  At the end of a
corridor there will be at least 3 directions to kick.

> There is also one corridor which has another
> closet, which has some sort of trap (wrenching feeling). Again,
> searching did no good...

That's a good sign.  Wrenching sensation means it's a
teleport trap (possibly level teleport but most likely a
teleport to a vault).  Take off your MR, step on the trap,
get sent to the vault, do the usual vault thing of letting
the guard escort you to some other part of the level.

> Every once in a while a monster will actually come out of the closet
> in the first room...but I don't see how!

That's the place to start your cycle of kick and search.

